    <summary>SSL and IPSec VPN client for Fortinet firewalls.</summary>
    <description>
FortiClient VPN is Fortinet's free, VPN-only client for connecting to FortiGate SSL and IPsec VPNs. This is the free edition — it does not include the full FortiClient endpoint-security suite (antivirus, web filtering, EMS management) and does not come with vendor technical support.

Installs to Fortinet's default location (`C:\Program Files\Fortinet\FortiClient\`) unless redirected via MSI properties.

This package has no stable, version-pinned download URL to install from: Fortinet only distributes FortiClient VPN through a self-updating online installer that fetches the real MSI over its own update protocol at run time. The install script runs that official online installer, captures the MSI it downloads, verifies Fortinet's Authenticode signature on both the installer and the MSI, and confirms the captured MSI's real version matches this package's version before installing — so you always get a signature-verified, version-confirmed install even without a fixed checksum to pin.

![Screenshot of FortiClient VPN](https://cdn.staticaly.com/gh/BJD1997/ChocolateyPackages/eb1ebf116e343e439a0ae5d5394280d58e2b222b/forticlientvpn/forticlientvpn_screenshot.png)
</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://docs.fortinet.com/product/forticlient</releaseNotes>
